<Pathway xmlns="http://pathvisio.org/GPML/2013a" Name="lipoprotein metabolism in peripheral tissues" Version="WP5620_r20260205154200" Author="[GYSteve]" Last-Modified="20260205154200" Organism="Homo sapiens">
  <Comment Source="WikiPathways-description"> This pathway incorporates different lipoprotein classes as well as their subclasses and components. It includes how these particles and their compositions transfer in peripheral tissues and the enzymes that are involved.</Comment>
